================================================================
Adapter weights (future, when published)
================================================================

The Maez voice-seed LoRA adapter, when published, will be released
separately under the Apache License 2.0 on HuggingFace at a URL to
be announced. Base-model weights must be obtained directly from the
upstream Qwen repository under the Qwen/Apache license terms.


================================================================
Contributing
================================================================

External code contributions require a Contributor License Agreement
(CLA) to be signed before merge. This preserves the ability to offer
commercial dual-licenses for enterprise use cases while keeping the
main code fully open under AGPL v3. No CLA is required to:
  - Report issues
  - Write documentation
  - Fork the project and maintain a separate variant

See README.md for contribution guidelines (to be added).
